1
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:29,250
[Live Forever]

2
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:32,950
[Episode 20]

3
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,470
Qiu.

4
00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:38,430
We're all safe now.

5
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:39,370
Let's go.

6
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:40,270
Let's go home.

7
00:00:50,170 --> 00:00:52,680
I want you to feel

8
00:00:52,750 --> 00:00:55,840
the pain of losing your loved ones.

9
00:01:36,490 --> 00:01:37,330
I'm fine.

10
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:38,950
I'll be okay in a minute.

11
00:01:39,350 --> 00:01:40,550
Just give me a minute.

12
00:01:41,750 --> 00:01:42,390
Qiu,

13
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:46,000
I thought this time

14
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,229
I could finally protect you.

15
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:49,479
No.

16
00:01:49,479 --> 00:01:50,560
Don't say that.

17
00:01:51,350 --> 00:01:52,560
I'm sorry.

18
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,120
Don't.

19
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,310
I failed again.

20
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:00,760
Qiu,

21
00:02:02,230 --> 00:02:03,560
do you still remember

22
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:06,680
how to break immortality?

23
00:02:09,970 --> 00:02:12,130
If I die,

24
00:02:13,310 --> 00:02:16,820
does that mean we truly love each other?

25
00:02:20,220 --> 00:02:21,100
No.

26
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,520
No.

27
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:29,030
I don't want this!

28
00:02:29,030 --> 00:02:30,870
You can't die!

29
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:32,280
I...

30
00:02:32,630 --> 00:02:33,430
No!

31
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,470
I don't love you!

32
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:40,310
I don't love you!

33
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:43,250
I don't love you!

34
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,120
Qiu...

35
00:02:47,030 --> 00:02:48,079
I want a hug.

36
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,730
Let me hug you.

37
00:03:12,410 --> 00:03:13,220
Qiu...

38
00:03:22,310 --> 00:03:23,120
Qiu.

39
00:03:24,310 --> 00:03:25,150
You're...

40
00:03:25,980 --> 00:03:27,210
free now.

41
00:03:56,590 --> 00:03:58,470
No!

42
00:03:58,470 --> 00:04:00,800
I don't love you.

43
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,680
I don't love you.

44
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:06,470
Ning Changyue, I don't love you.

45
00:04:07,590 --> 00:04:10,840
I don't love you, Ning Changyue!

46
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:13,080
I don't love you!

47
00:04:18,750 --> 00:04:20,720
No!

48
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:27,000
I don't love you!

49
00:04:43,060 --> 00:04:44,690
Ning Changyue!

50
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,190
Ning Changyue!

51
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,600
Ning Changyue!

52
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,430
Ning Changyue!

53
00:05:02,020 --> 00:05:07,250
♪ Why do you insist on finding me? ♪

54
00:05:03,430 --> 00:05:04,240
Coming.

55
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,200
Why did you drink so much?

56
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,160
Does your head hurt?

57
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:08,600
Here.

58
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:09,240
Let me massage it.

59
00:05:08,870 --> 00:05:14,390
♪ You know I didn't want to stay ♪

60
00:05:11,510 --> 00:05:12,040
How is it?

61
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,000
Better?

62
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,750
That's what you get for drinking so much.

63
00:05:16,750 --> 00:05:23,380
♪ You hold me tight ♪

64
00:05:16,950 --> 00:05:17,750
Regret it now?

65
00:05:23,690 --> 00:05:29,130
♪ But I am fading away ♪

66
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:38,950
Let's go.

67
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,630
I don't want to go.

68
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:42,630
Why are you so lazy?

69
00:05:42,630 --> 00:05:43,890
You little lazybones.

70
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:45,040
I don't want to go.

71
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:45,830
Alright, alright.

72
00:05:45,730 --> 00:05:52,630
♪ You hold me tight ♪

73
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:46,920
Once we're done,

74
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,920
I'll take you out for some nice food.

75
00:05:49,830 --> 00:05:50,490
Sound good?

76
00:05:53,300 --> 00:05:58,640
♪ I lose my way ♪

77
00:06:08,070 --> 00:06:09,270
You're back.

78
00:06:09,950 --> 00:06:11,010
I'm out of battery.

79
00:06:11,390 --> 00:06:12,120
I can't move.

80
00:06:12,510 --> 00:06:13,510
Need to recharge.

81
00:06:15,650 --> 00:06:17,090
Okay, okay.

82
00:06:18,070 --> 00:06:19,560
Alright.

83
00:06:19,950 --> 00:06:21,560
No, not fully charged yet.

84
00:06:21,730 --> 00:06:23,040
Charge a little longer.

85
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,040
That's enough.

86
00:06:25,780 --> 00:06:26,480
Need more.

87
00:06:27,230 --> 00:06:33,230
♪ Will you still think of me? ♪

88
00:06:27,750 --> 00:06:29,830
I need more. Not full yet.

89
00:06:29,830 --> 00:06:31,070
Why is there a fish missing?

90
00:06:31,070 --> 00:06:32,020
I want a cuddle.

91
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:34,190
Give me a cuddle.

92
00:06:34,130 --> 00:06:38,720
♪ Do you know I was afraid? ♪

93
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,600
Forget the fish.

94
00:06:40,980 --> 00:06:42,860
Beg me, and I'll cook for you today.

95
00:06:41,260 --> 00:06:47,980
♪ When you used to hold me tight ♪

96
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:48,570
Please, babe.

97
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,310
Call me hubby.

98
00:06:48,860 --> 00:06:58,230
♪ I lost my way right then ♪

99
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,500
Please, hubby.

100
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:52,840
Give me a kiss.

101
00:06:52,870 --> 00:06:53,920
Oh, stop it.

102
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:55,630
Fine...

103
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,640
We're having beef today.

104
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,270
We made a promise.

105
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,840
We have to watch it together.

106
00:07:42,390 --> 00:07:44,159
Watch it bloom.

107
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:51,720
Ning Changyue,

108
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:56,360
you liar.

109
00:08:19,310 --> 00:08:20,260
Aunt Song,

110
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:22,360
have you...

111
00:08:22,870 --> 00:08:24,310
not eaten for days?

112
00:08:27,430 --> 00:08:28,160
How about...

113
00:08:28,750 --> 00:08:29,920
we go out for a walk?

114
00:08:30,580 --> 00:08:33,890
[Three Months Later]

115
00:08:37,750 --> 00:08:38,440
Over here.

116
00:08:38,770 --> 00:08:39,559
A little more here.

117
00:08:39,559 --> 00:08:40,039
Okay.

118
00:08:40,059 --> 00:08:41,100
Nice and red.

119
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,030
So pretty this way.

120
00:08:45,030 --> 00:08:45,670
Right?

121
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:46,870
Perfect.

122
00:08:48,060 --> 00:08:49,120
Just stay here with us

123
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,760
and enjoy the sunshine.

124
00:08:55,890 --> 00:08:56,720
Qiu.

125
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:17,240
What are you looking at?

126
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:18,040
What's wrong?

127
00:09:27,510 --> 00:09:29,110
I bet you didn't expect this.

128
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,320
I saw everything.

129
00:09:33,750 --> 00:09:35,990
You finally go out today.

130
00:09:36,010 --> 00:09:37,150
And you're in a bad mood.

131
00:09:37,150 --> 00:09:39,360
Let's just forget about everything
for a while.

132
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:39,860
And...

133
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,640
have a drink to relax.

134
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:42,320
Okay?

135
00:09:43,030 --> 00:09:43,560
Sit down.

136
00:09:43,790 --> 00:09:44,450
Have a seat.

137
00:09:45,150 --> 00:09:45,750
Okay.

138
00:09:48,230 --> 00:09:49,510
Do you remember the last time

139
00:09:49,510 --> 00:09:50,510
you were here?

140
00:09:51,670 --> 00:09:52,390
Seriously,

141
00:09:52,530 --> 00:09:54,460
you were the craziest person
I've ever seen.

142
00:09:54,460 --> 00:09:55,390
You were so cute.

143
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,200
Hello.

144
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,440
Hello, Ms. Song.

145
00:09:59,630 --> 00:10:01,840
This is Eternal Vows Wedding Planning.

146
00:10:01,980 --> 00:10:02,790
Mr. Ning Changyue

147
00:10:02,790 --> 00:10:03,360
booked a full wedding package

148
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,330
with us

149
00:10:04,350 --> 00:10:05,900
three months ago.

150
00:10:06,270 --> 00:10:08,870
The venue and catering are all set.

151
00:10:08,870 --> 00:10:10,540
The wedding is scheduled for next week.

152
00:10:10,540 --> 00:10:11,900
We just wanted to confirm

153
00:10:11,900 --> 00:10:13,900
if there are any changes on your end.

154
00:10:15,750 --> 00:10:16,600
Ms. Song?

155
00:10:17,550 --> 00:10:18,550
No changes.

156
00:10:19,300 --> 00:10:19,850
Alright.

157
00:10:20,330 --> 00:10:21,570
I won't bother you any further.

158
00:10:21,570 --> 00:10:22,600
Have a great day.

159
00:10:29,630 --> 00:10:30,720
Idiot.

160
00:10:32,690 --> 00:10:34,980
You started preparing three months ago.

161
00:11:01,700 --> 00:11:02,270
Qiu,

162
00:11:02,820 --> 00:11:03,660
marry me.

163
00:11:36,710 --> 00:11:45,400
♪ Writing all over your walls ♪

164
00:11:40,630 --> 00:11:41,750
Ning Changyue,

165
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,120
at first,

166
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:47,240
I thought immortality was a reward.

167
00:11:45,980 --> 00:11:55,490
♪ I was here but now I must leave ♪

168
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:50,360
Like the gods favored us,

169
00:11:51,460 --> 00:11:54,630
stretching out our time inch by inch,

170
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:58,000
so we could have each other forever.

171
00:11:59,150 --> 00:12:00,870
But later I realized

172
00:12:01,770 --> 00:12:05,170
time never deepens love on its own.

173
00:12:06,670 --> 00:12:08,910
Sometimes it wears down the passion,

174
00:12:09,250 --> 00:12:10,770
and dilutes the thrill.

175
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:15,000
It makes the earth-shattering romance

176
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:19,000
slowly fade into
the mundane routine of daily life.

177
00:12:20,550 --> 00:12:21,750
During that time,

178
00:12:21,030 --> 00:12:25,160
♪ I won't fall in a cage ♪

179
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:26,270
I thought I had lost it.

180
00:12:25,180 --> 00:12:27,160
♪ Missing old days ♪

181
00:12:26,790 --> 00:12:27,870
I thought I forgot

182
00:12:27,270 --> 00:12:33,660
♪ I will be here, I will stay ♪

183
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:29,910
what love

184
00:12:31,270 --> 00:12:32,670
truly is.

185
00:12:34,050 --> 00:12:37,160
♪ Let them judge as they please ♪

186
00:12:37,610 --> 00:12:39,730
♪ There will be brighter days ♪

187
00:12:39,970 --> 00:12:45,700
♪ I will stay ♪

188
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:48,890
Ms. Song Yiqiu,

189
00:12:49,430 --> 00:12:50,470
before the vows,

190
00:12:51,380 --> 00:12:53,110
on behalf of Mr. Ning Changyue,

191
00:12:53,450 --> 00:12:54,910
I'd like to give you a gift.

192
00:12:58,720 --> 00:12:59,440
Hi!

193
00:12:59,460 --> 00:13:00,460
It's Wu Ya here.

194
00:13:00,490 --> 00:13:01,440
Welcome to my uncle's

195
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:03,160
secret wedding prep vlog!

196
00:13:03,190 --> 00:13:03,880
Let's go!

197
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:06,910
My uncle

198
00:13:06,910 --> 00:13:08,550
has been acting super sneaky lately.

199
00:13:08,550 --> 00:13:09,720
I have no idea what he's up to.

200
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:11,450
Let's go check it out together.

201
00:13:12,910 --> 00:13:13,630
Uncle!

202
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:17,200
Are you planning to propose?

203
00:13:18,830 --> 00:13:19,880
Are you?

204
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:20,870
Are you?

205
00:13:20,160 --> 00:13:23,780
♪ Two mismatching souls ♪

206
00:13:20,870 --> 00:13:21,600
Are you?

207
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:22,510
Tell me!

208
00:13:22,510 --> 00:13:23,510
Give me the phone.

209
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:27,220
♪ We never saw it coming ♪

210
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:25,890
No! I'm going

211
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:26,840
to tell Aunt Song now!

212
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:28,080
Hand over the phone!

213
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:33,960
♪ Forever is shorter than we thought ♪

214
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:28,600
If she finds out,

215
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:29,440
-I'll kill you!
-No!

216
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:30,200
No way!

217
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:34,340
Stay still.

218
00:13:34,340 --> 00:13:37,860
♪ The fading shadows of our love ♪

219
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,150
What's this?

220
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:41,350
♪ Echoing endlessly in the dark ♪

221
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:39,320
Qiu's ring size.

222
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:40,770
Come with me to buy the ring.

223
00:13:40,770 --> 00:13:42,550
You used this to measure Qiu's finger?

224
00:13:41,380 --> 00:13:48,150
♪ Don't cling to what should have been ♪

225
00:13:42,910 --> 00:13:44,440
She's going to be your aunt.

226
00:13:45,030 --> 00:13:47,600
Isn't this a bit sketchy?

227
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:48,370
Sketchy?

228
00:13:48,780 --> 00:13:52,860
♪ We can't keep fighting for a ghost ♪

229
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,510
Mind your own business.

230
00:13:50,510 --> 00:13:52,240
Where can I find a tape measure?

231
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:55,780
♪ This empty house isn't a home ♪

232
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:53,970
Hurry up.

233
00:13:54,030 --> 00:13:55,000
I can't hold this shape much longer.

234
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:55,550
Let's go.

235
00:13:56,040 --> 00:14:01,540
♪ I think it's time to let us go ♪

236
00:13:56,670 --> 00:13:58,870
This is Aunt Song's ring finger, right?

237
00:14:02,090 --> 00:14:03,360
♪ Admit it ♪

238
00:14:03,730 --> 00:14:08,370
♪ What we already know ♪

239
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,000
Give me a sec.

240
00:14:08,450 --> 00:14:09,570
First time getting married,

241
00:14:08,570 --> 00:14:13,520
♪ We can't keep fighting for the ghosts ♪

242
00:14:09,630 --> 00:14:10,830
he lacks experience.

243
00:14:12,030 --> 00:14:12,900
Song Yiqiu,

244
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:14,320
will you...

245
00:14:14,510 --> 00:14:15,030
Stop.

246
00:14:15,390 --> 00:14:16,360
Your eyes are too stiff.

247
00:14:15,970 --> 00:14:19,800
♪ We can't keep fighting for the ghosts ♪

248
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:17,420
You look like an AI.

249
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:20,030
Come on, what do you want from me?

250
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:23,150
♪ This empty house isn't a home ♪

251
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:20,910
Uncle,

252
00:14:21,270 --> 00:14:22,210
you need to be sincere.

253
00:14:22,210 --> 00:14:23,140
Keep it natural.

254
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:28,440
♪ I think it's time to let us go ♪

255
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:25,630
Make her feel your heartbeat.

256
00:14:28,880 --> 00:14:30,270
♪ Admit it ♪

257
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:36,610
♪ What we already know ♪

258
00:14:37,110 --> 00:14:40,690
♪ We can't keep fighting for the ghosts ♪

259
00:14:45,090 --> 00:14:45,670
Qiu,

260
00:14:51,450 --> 00:14:52,210
we

261
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,630
spent 3000 years together,

262
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:01,210
from being immortal

263
00:15:02,630 --> 00:15:04,490
to becoming ordinary people now.

264
00:15:07,790 --> 00:15:08,910
I want to ask

265
00:15:12,400 --> 00:15:14,510
can I be the one

266
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:18,630
who stays by your side,

267
00:15:20,380 --> 00:15:22,180
and makes you happy every day?

268
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:29,200
I love you.

269
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:35,240
Uncle,

270
00:15:36,890 --> 00:15:38,050
I actually

271
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:39,030
didn't record

272
00:15:39,670 --> 00:15:40,840
any of that.

273
00:15:42,510 --> 00:15:43,310
My phone died.

274
00:15:43,950 --> 00:15:45,190
I just wanted to see

275
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:46,750
how long you'd practice.

276
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:49,840
I'll love you forever!

277
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:50,870
I'm going to...

278
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:52,440
Can't catch me!

279
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:53,790
Forgot to turn it off!

280
00:15:56,460 --> 00:15:57,820
But right now...

281
00:15:59,210 --> 00:16:00,780
I think I understand again.

282
00:16:01,550 --> 00:16:03,750
It's just the subconscious habit

283
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:07,290
of wanting to call your name
every time I turn around.

284
00:16:07,670 --> 00:16:10,030
It's the napkin you always have ready

285
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:13,750
whenever I pop open a beer.

286
00:16:14,370 --> 00:16:16,500
It's the way, over thousands of years,

287
00:16:16,550 --> 00:16:18,270
you never hesitated

288
00:16:18,270 --> 00:16:20,200
to run toward me.

289
00:16:21,250 --> 00:16:23,010
Immortality may end,

290
00:16:24,070 --> 00:16:25,120
but love

291
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:27,110
is eternal.

292
00:16:29,550 --> 00:16:30,670
Ms. Song Yiqiu,

293
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,360
do you

294
00:16:34,270 --> 00:16:36,600
take Mr. Ning Changyue to be your husband?

295
00:16:37,790 --> 00:16:39,080
For better, for worse,

296
00:16:39,630 --> 00:16:40,960
for richer, for poorer,

297
